  "Chips and the Ice Cube\n\nChips has seeds to plant but no empty pot. One tub holds a big ice cube. Chips tries to tip it out. The cube is stuck. Out in the sun, the ice slowly melts into water. Chips pours it away and adds soil. Now Chips can use the tub for seeds.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b421c3b1da88a95d53d6.mp3",
