  "Chompy Makes a Game\n\nFive stones and a cup were all Chompy needed for a game. To make a goal, Chompy laid the cup on its side. Chompy drew a line and slid one stone from there. It stopped short of the cup. Chompy moved the cup closer. The next stone went in.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6b6985e71b7ec8daff97.mp3",
