  "Muddy and the Rain Pail\n\nMuddy set a pail outside to catch rain for a plant. The rain fell in, but the pail never filled. Drops came through a hole in the bottom. Instead of waiting for more rain, Muddy fetched a bowl. It fit under the pail and caught the drops. There was water for the plant after all.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a75aa5fe813ad18f2426.mp3",
