  "Socks at the Beach\n\nOn the beach, the wind blew a red cap off Socks. It landed on a rock by the sea. From the sand, Socks stretched but could not reach it. A long stick could. Socks pushed the cap off the rock with the stick. It dropped onto the sand, and Socks picked it up.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/576e8f46089ca558b479.mp3",
