  "Chips and the Little Boat\n\nA leaf made a fine little boat for Chips. Chips set it on the pool and added a stone. Down went the boat. Chips took the stone out and tried a small dry stick. The stick did not soak up much water. This time the leaf could float all the way across.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/bc8ba8f118eef069d8e4.mp3",
