  "Chompy in the Snow\n\nChompy rolled a little ball of snow down a low hill. Chompy watched it grow bigger and bigger. A row of stones lay straight ahead. Chompy put a pile of snow in front of the ball. It hit the pile and began to slow down. The ball stopped just short of the stones.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d55e42596dd30a91f6f2.mp3",
