  "Fluff and the Blue Sign\n\nAt Fluff's table, a blue sign promised ten seeds per bag. Fluff counted the seeds before sticking up the sign. One bag held just nine. In went another seed. Now the sign was right for every bag. Fluff used glue to stick it to the table.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8748f6ffea666e32e8e8.mp3",
