  "Socks Makes a Trail\n\nPaper arrows showed the way along Socks's picnic trail. Rain soaked one arrow, and the paper tore. Socks gathered flat stones from the trail. “These could point the way,” Socks said. Socks laid them in arrow shapes. They could stay in place even in the rain. Socks followed the arrows with the picnic food.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e31884562caf786a3735.mp3",
