  "Muddy Waits for the Bus\n\nMuddy waited at a bus stop beside the shop. It was hot in the sun. Muddy put on a hat from the bag and sat down. From the bench, Muddy saw a bus pull up by the shop. Muddy got up, took the bag and climbed on.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d165f0114ca174ad41c8.mp3",
