  "Muddy Finds a Lid\n\nSteam rose from Muddy's pot of soup. A small lid lay by the sink. Muddy tried it on the pot. Part of the soup still showed around the edge. On the shelf was a bigger lid. That one was a good fit and covered all the soup.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8c3854aac7d91c49c5b1.mp3",
