  "Pip Closes the Bag\n\nPip put a cap in the bag for the park. Halfway across, the zip stuck. A bit of the cap poked up between its sides. Pip opened the zip and pushed the cap down. The zip went all the way across on the next try. “Ready now,” said Pip, taking the closed bag to the park.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fcabf0342b90c4ba8677.mp3",
