  "Fluff Tries Two Pens\n\nFluff wanted a red hen on the page. The first red pen left no line. Fluff tried it on some scrap paper too. Still no mark! Into the bin went the dry pen. Another red pen soon gave the hen two legs and a tail.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/baa68ca4ca4649e384c2.mp3",
