  "Socks Dries a Hat\n\nSocks lifts a hat from the tub and hangs it outside. From the peg, the wet hat drips onto the grass. Later, Socks comes back and feels the hat. This time it is dry. Only then does Socks put the hat in a bag.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9c92cececd650accfd7b.mp3",
