  "Socks Counts the Pens\n\nSix places at the table needed pens. Socks counted five in the box. The corner of a book was resting on another pen. Socks lifted the book and pulled the pen out. That made six pens, just enough. Socks put one at each place.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/079b3f6a11596bdeafee.mp3",
