  "Chips at the Park\n\nThe sun was hot at the park. Chips wore a cap and left a bag beside a tree. Chips gave the ball a kick and it rolled behind the tree. Chips looked where the ball had gone and walked around. There it was. The ball went into the bag for the walk home.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/993842d398be1a16c291.mp3",
