  "Chips Follows a Map\n\nA red dot on Chips's map marked the pond. Chips walked past the swings until the path split in two. Which way now? At the fork, Chips checked the map again. The pond was on the left, so Chips turned left. Chips sat on a bench and watched ducks on the pond.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/1d55abb46b4bb9690611.mp3",
