  "Chompy Spreads the Jam\n\nChompy puts bread on a plate for a snack. The red jam is ready, but the lid won't turn. Socks holds the jar and helps Chompy open it. Chompy spreads jam over the bread with a spoon. One cut makes two pieces. “This one's for you,” Chompy tells Socks.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/10e8a19ceea7621b8522.mp3",
