  "Chompy Sorts the Rubbish\n\nTwo bins stood by the door. Chompy carried a paper bag and an empty can. One bin said cans and the other said paper. Chompy read both words before dropping anything in. The can went in the first bin. The paper bag went in the other.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0ecc53883733f29da872.mp3",
