  "Muddy Shops for Lunch\n\nMilk, bread and apples were on Muddy's shopping list. At the shop, Muddy found the milk on a cold shelf. Bread went into the basket next. Muddy read the list again. By the door sat a pile of apples. Muddy took three and paid for the food.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/06e5dc2173c6c8196051.mp3",
