  "Muddy Hangs the Ring\n\nThe bell has a ring on top. Muddy threads a long string through that ring. The other end is tied round a low branch. Now the bell hangs just above the ground. Muddy pulls it over and lets go. It swings back with a sound.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/782300ff814f403eadca.mp3",
