  "Pip Cleans the Sink\n\nPip paints a pot pink. At the sink, water washes the paint from the brush. Pink spots splash onto the side of the sink. Pip wipes them with a cloth. Now the cloth needs washing too. Pip rinses it and hangs it up. The brush dries in a jar.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/19d6231fcac0b96006d0.mp3",
