  "Fluff Washes a Bath Toy\n\nUnder a shelf lay an old bath toy. Dust covered it from end to end. Fluff washed it in a bowl of warm water. Fluff dried it with a towel, then set it beside the bath. The towel went on a hook to dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/4dfa3fc10e56c1fc5780.mp3",
