  "Socks Cleans the Steps\n\nDry leaves covered the steps down to the path. Socks started at the top with a broom. Leaves and dust fell onto each lower step. At the last step, the whole pile slid onto the path. Socks swept it together and filled a bag. The steps were clear from top to bottom.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/cc2f44a1a695469ad327.mp3",
