  "Chips Washes a Brush\n\nGreen paint clings to the brush after Chips paints a box. Chips washes the brush while the paint is still wet. Water runs out green at first. Chips squeezes the water out and lays the brush flat. When the brush is dry, it goes on the shelf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6bdb2da8e21e05d2b7e0.mp3",
