  "Chips Opens the Chest\n\nChips wants a scarf for a puppet. The scarf is in a chest full of dress-up clothes. Chips pulls at the lid. It stays shut. Chips checks the front and lifts a small latch. Up goes the lid. Chips finds the scarf under a hat and wraps the puppet up.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8b26e5640ce733247f91.mp3",
