  "Chompy Folds Paper\n\nChompy wanted a paper hat for a toy bear. The first sheet was thick. Even with both hands, Chompy could hardly fold it. A thin sheet bent much more easily. Chompy folded that sheet into a hat. The bear sat on a chair wearing it.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6fe0217ac67dd5b55d6c.mp3",
