  "Muddy Closes the Gate\n\nMuddy made a garden with a gate beside the house. One day the gate would not close. A stone filled the space under it. Muddy rolled the stone over beside a pot. This time the gate swung all the way shut. It stayed shut when Muddy let go.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/aa3ddc71d9b0dc16863d.mp3",
