  "Pip Mends a Page\n\nWhile Pip was reading, a page caught on a finger. A small tear opened near the bottom. Pip laid the book flat and brought the torn edges together. A strip of clear tape held them in place. Pip turned the page slowly and read on.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/85951cf6e8ae4a36ed40.mp3",
