  "Pip Marks a Wet Floor\n\nWet boots left drops on the floor when Pip came home. Pip took off the boots and fetched a mop. A damp spot still showed by the door. Pip put a cone beside it so people could walk around. The floor dried. Pip picked up the cone and put it away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0fe9b4dba09758a550c7.mp3",
