  "Fluff Stops on a Hike\n\nThe hike took Fluff up a long hill. At the top stood a wide tree. Fluff put the bag down there for a drink of water. On the other side of the tree was a bench. Fluff rested on the bench before starting back down.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0b6d58dd123b39bd6551.mp3",
