  "Chips Sets Up a Race\n\nFive toy cars waited at a line on Chips's long board. For the race, Chips slipped a block under one end. Down the board went all five cars. The yellow car stopped first. The red car kept going until it reached the end.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8e0e19f88c41a0c2ce3c.mp3",
