  "Chompy Packs a Case\n\nChompy packed a shirt, socks and a book in a case. At the door stood Pip's case, the same colour and size. “They look the same,” said Chompy. Chompy wrote a name on a card. With the card hanging from the handle, the two looked different.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5d6891e1c5035d0e6a9d.mp3",
