  "Muddy Takes the Train\n\nMuddy waits behind the yellow line on the platform. A train pulls in and stops. Muddy checks the number on its door against the ticket. “This is my train,” says Muddy when the numbers match. Muddy steps inside and finds a seat. The doors close, and the train moves again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6e5051ce2e93d6f0aabc.mp3",
