  "Fluff Leaves Snow Outside\n\nSnow clings to Fluff's boots on the walk home. At the door, Fluff brushes most of it off outside. The boots go on a tray below the window. A little snow still sticks to them. As it melts, water drips into the tray. The floor stays dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a3ce8bca5d7731b79de9.mp3",
