  "Fluff Packs at Night\n\nAt night, Fluff packed a bag for swimming in the morning. In went a towel and goggles. Fluff switched on a bright light to check. “My swimsuit,” said Fluff, spotting it on the bed. Fluff folded it and tucked it into the bag. The full bag waited beside the door.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e8220ad1f06a73d5fafe.mp3",
