  "Chompy Shares a Peach\n\nChompy washes a peach for a snack. Muddy helps cut around the hard stone in the middle. Soon the slices lie on a plate. Muddy and Pip get two slices each. Chompy eats the last one while Muddy washes the knife and plate. The stone goes in the food bin.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0499e344630335efd501.mp3",
