  "Chompy Crosses the Road\n\nChompy pulled on a coat for a walk with Muddy. At the road, the light at the crossing was red. They waited while Chompy pressed the button. The walking light turned green. Together they checked that the cars had stopped. Only then did they cross the road to the library.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5641578a2c1e9d296e0f.mp3",
