  "Pip and the Red Net\n\nA red net hangs on a peg with a leaf caught inside. Pip pulls the leaf free and drops it in the bin. At the pond, an empty can floats just out of reach. This time Pip wants something to get caught in the net. One quick scoop brings the can out of the water. Into the bin it goes, beside the leaf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b6c3c2ac2ea63d80672d.mp3",
