  "Socks Makes a Drum\n\nSocks taps the top of an empty box with a spoon. A low sound comes from the box. Socks sets a small pot beside it and taps again. This sound is high. Now Socks takes turns tapping the box and the pot. Low, high, low, high! Pip claps along.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/db677c26674d11ace528.mp3",
