  "Chips Lets the Bug Go\n\nA bug crawls into a cup and stops at the bottom. Chips picks the cup up slowly. Chips carries the bug outside to a bush. Chips sets the cup down and waits. A leaf touches the edge of the cup. Out crawls the bug, onto the leaf. Only then does Chips take the empty cup back inside.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/7ee6c9236bd1bd870e78.mp3",
