  "Chompy Tries a Cap\n\nAt the hat shop, Chompy tries on a cap. Down it slips, right over Chompy’s eyes. “I can’t see you,” Chompy tells the shopkeeper. Chompy lifts the cap and hands it back. A smaller cap sits just above the eyes. Chompy can see the shopkeeper again and buys that cap. The shopkeeper slips it into a paper bag.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/be6f1fcb2483e96640c2.mp3",
