  "Muddy Packs the Eggs\n\nMuddy gets ten eggs from the hen house. Beside the basket stands a box with six spaces. One egg goes into each space. The box is full, but the basket is not empty. Four eggs still need a place. Muddy packs those four and carefully carries both boxes.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/bd810b0e33ec4bfaece4.mp3",
