  "Pip Pins the Picture\n\nPip draws a big wheel and puts the picture on a board. One pin goes through each top corner of the paper. From the back of the room, only half the wheel shows. The bottom of the paper has curled up. Pip adds two pins at the bottom. Now the whole wheel shows, even from far away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/043fd31b74bea2529d71.mp3",
