  "Socks Rolls the Rug\n\nSocks rolls up one end of the rug to clean underneath. There is the dust, and there is a lost button too. Before sweeping, Socks puts the button in a little cup. The broom sweeps the dust into a pile. Socks unrolls the rug over the clean floor. The button stays safe in the cup.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/934f07cbb280c77988fd.mp3",
