  "Chips Draws the Route\n\nChips draws a map from home to the library. The park and the bakery both get a place on it. Which way does the path go? Chips draws a line from the house to the park. From the park the line goes straight to the library. Chips folds the map and puts it in a bag. At the library, Chips can follow the lines back home.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e64420e85af37bf9bbe8.mp3",
