  "Chompy Makes a Toy Bed\n\nChompy gets a red box just big enough for a toy bear. The box will be a bed, but the bear needs a pillow. Chompy folds a cloth and slips it under the bear’s head. A little blanket goes over the bear, up to its chin. Its face peeks out above the blanket.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/850c40b577c3bd2a02a3.mp3",
