  "Muddy Makes a Square\n\nSix sticks rattle in Muddy’s tin. Four make a square and two stay in the tin. Pip asks, “Can we make a bigger square?” Muddy spreads the four sticks farther apart. There is a gap at every corner now. Pip brings four longer sticks. This time the corners meet around a bigger space.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a701ddb7d32672f939ce.mp3",
