  "Pip Hops on the Spots\n\nPip draws a trail of chalk spots on the ground. One hop takes Pip from spot to spot. Socks watches the first hop and wants a turn. The gap looks long for Socks. Pip draws an extra spot near the start. Socks can stop on it, then hop on to the next spot.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9d00a0bfffeeb39fb03f.mp3",
