  "Fluff Finds a Mug\n\nSomeone left a mug on the picnic table. Fluff lifts it up and turns it just enough to look underneath. A name! The mug belongs to Socks. Fluff finds Socks by the gate and hands it over. Socks waves, and Fluff goes back for a cup of water.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8894f199f2ce1430b3ac.mp3",
