  "Socks Makes a Pancake\n\nSocks sets a pan on the cooker. An adult turns on the heat while Socks holds the pancake mix. Socks adds some mix to the pan. It spreads out in a flat circle. Little bubbles pop up on top. The adult turns the pancake over so the other side can cook.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ea8c10ac27b649edbe8c.mp3",
