  "Chips Fixes the Wobble\n\nWhen Chips leans on the table, it tips to one side. One leg stops just above the floor. Chips gets a piece of card and folds it. The folded card slides under the short leg. This time all four legs have something to rest on. Chips can set a cup down without a wobble.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/569a18e663dc6f8d7115.mp3",
