  "Muddy Draws on the Window\n\nIt is cold outside and warm on Muddy’s bus. The window is covered in fog. Muddy draws a circle on the glass with one hoof. A tree comes into view through the clear circle. For a little while Muddy can see every branch. Then fog creeps back over the circle and hides the tree.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/75108692ad230e2156a1.mp3",
