  "Pip Counts the Shells\n\nPip picks up four empty nut shells under a tree. Five little cups stand in a row. Pip drops one shell in each cup until the shells run out. Pip checks the whole row and goes looking again. Under some fallen leaves, Pip spots another shell. That one goes in the last cup.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/66684efc1f82dcb5801a.mp3",
