  "Socks Finds a Quiet Spot\n\nA pet cat curls up in the bed Socks made. Bang! The door shuts, and the cat lifts its head. Every time the door shuts, the cat wakes up again. Socks carries the bed away from the door. Under a low shelf the cat curls up once more. This time it stays asleep.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/08fdc080eb90c9b58f14.mp3",
