  "Chompy Spots a Fox\n\nOne photo in Chompy’s book shows a fox beside a log. “It’s so still it must be asleep,” says Chompy. Pip points to its open eyes and asks, “Asleep?” No, that fox is not asleep! Chompy takes another look. There on the log is a little mouse that Chompy missed before.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/500a9b0475987b18dc6b.mp3",
