  "Muddy Sorts the Shells\n\nMuddy brings shells from the beach for Pip to see. They have two different shapes. Muddy sorts the long shells into one dish. The round ones go into another. When both dishes are ready, Muddy sets them on a low shelf. Pip can look at each group without mixing up the shells.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/16b20c99d32302996361.mp3",
