  "Fluff Paints a Road\n\nFluff uses a wide brush to paint a road on paper. A thin brush makes short lines down the middle. Beside the road, Fluff leaves room for a park. The toy cars are ready before the road is. Fluff waits until the paint dries to put them down. Then Fluff shows Socks the new place to play.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c9e6948632d8d22d4c80.mp3",
