  "Socks Makes a Shadow\n\nIn the sunshine, Socks finds a shadow on the wall. One arm goes up. The shadow on the wall lifts an arm too! Pip holds a leaf up beside Socks. A smaller shape appears next to the first one. Socks shows Pip how closely that shape matches the leaf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9468e9f0f80fe8b5f741.mp3",
