  "Pip Marks the Turn\n\nPip builds a track for toy cars that turns beside a tree. How will Socks know which way to push the car? Pip chooses a piece of chalk and draws an arrow. It points around the turn. As Socks comes along the track, Pip checks the arrow. Socks can see it before reaching the tree.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/dba6e7efaa27d308737f.mp3",
