  "Fluff Makes a Puppet\n\nDeep in the costume chest, Fluff finds an old sock. Fluff chooses two buttons for a pair of eyes. Muddy helps sew them on. A red cloth tongue hangs below the chin. Fluff slips a paw inside the sock and opens its mouth. A little bow from the puppet makes Pip laugh.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b49b4709685d0855c48f.mp3",
  "Which part does Muddy help attach?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f7dffd8c3665c9c04bf7.mp3",
