  "Socks Chooses Lunch\n\nSocks reads the lunch menu at the counter. Soup or a cheese sandwich? Socks orders the sandwich and asks for water as well. The cook hands over a plate. Socks carries it to an empty table. A tall cup of water arrives to go with the sandwich.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fa0cc4b6f781a12a8cb6.mp3",
