  "Chips Weaves with Thread\n\nThree threads hang from a card, one for each row of holes. Chips takes red thread through the top row. Blue goes through the middle and yellow through the bottom. On the front, the colours run in neat rows. On the back, Chips ties the loose ends together.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b268a3be0252b34178de.mp3",
  "Why does Chips need three threads?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6a41f64340359be4447b.mp3",
