  "Chompy Stirs the Soup\n\nThe soup is so thick that Chompy can hardly pour it. Chompy stirs it with a spoon, but it stays thick. Muddy adds a little warm water. Chompy stirs again. Now the soup is thin enough to pour into two bowls. They leave the bowls to cool before taking a taste.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/aa3625bf923a47a795c2.mp3",
