  "Muddy Dries the Toy\n\nBath time is over, but water still fills the toy boat. Muddy lifts it out and water runs from both ends. Over the bath, Muddy tips it upside down. Out fall the last few drops. Muddy dries the outside with a cloth. The boat waits on the shelf for tomorrow’s bath.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3566553ea7b0d8a0c2a8.mp3",
