  "To rinse the outside of the boat": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/53a61a6a31c2456f1390.mp3",
  "To catch water coming off the cloth": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/89899f8532bfe9560eeb.mp3",
  "Pip Checks the Pots\n\nThree plants share a windowsill. Pip feels the soil in each pot before getting any water. The first two pots feel damp. Only the third has dry soil. Pip waters that plant, and some water runs into its tray. After emptying the tray, Pip puts the pot beside the others again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ed0fb8f3cce59718f02e.mp3",
  "Which plant does Pip water?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2c219bf02bd744eba9f3.mp3",
