  "Fluff Tests a Paper Bridge\n\nTwo blocks with a gap between them make banks for a bridge. Fluff lays thin paper across both blocks. When a toy car rolls on, the middle bends. Fluff lifts the car off and folds a piece of thick card. This bridge stays straight across the same two blocks. The car makes it all the way across.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e53f9f8284cae423fccd.mp3",
