  "Socks Measures the Path\n\nSocks starts at the gate with a stick and some chalk. Each time the stick ends, Socks marks the path. Six stick lengths reach the last stone by the tree. Pip starts at the same gate with a shorter stick. It takes more lengths to get to the very same stone. The path has not changed.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c4560d69fa2155c9c8ab.mp3",
  "What does one chalk mark show?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ecd90c24d4df39ac7786.mp3",
