  "Chips Makes a Stamp Pattern\n\nA star, a circle, a star, a circle. Chips uses a stamp for each shape. Near the end, two circles sit side by side. Chips stops and runs a finger along the row. A star belongs where the extra circle sits. Chips covers that circle with a small paper star.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e047371420bb3bd8c589.mp3",
