  "Chompy Follows the List\n\nThe room needs tidying, and Chompy has a picture list. Books on a shelf come first. Chompy puts the books away and looks at the next picture. Blocks, then toy cars. The last picture shows a clear floor. Chompy checks the floor against the picture before putting the list away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/efbab7e5875a0a76d249.mp3",
