  "Muddy Opens the Tent\n\nMuddy lifts the front flap of the tent. A gust drops it right back across the opening. Pip cannot stand in the doorway without holding it up. Muddy rolls the flap from the bottom and fastens two straps. The roll stays above Pip’s head. Now both friends can feel fresh air coming in.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/258bb87a7f19c3fe46b9.mp3",
