  "Pip Labels the Plants\n\nTwo plants stand in pots, but Pip cannot read their names yet. One plant has round leaves and the other has long ones. Pip draws a round leaf on one card. A long leaf goes on the other card. Pip sets each card in front of the plant it matches. The leaf shapes tell Pip which plant is which.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b7e19bd1e84a89a77e86.mp3",
