  "Fluff Tries a Cup Phone\n\nFluff makes a phone with two cups and a long string. Pip takes one cup across the room. Fluff pulls the string straight and speaks into the other cup. “I hear you,” calls Pip as the words travel along the string. Then the string hangs loose between them. The words sound much less clear.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/510e31aa942c1254bcf3.mp3",
