  "Socks Makes Paper Rings\n\nSocks bends a pink strip of paper into a ring. A dab of glue holds the ends together. A blue strip slips through the pink ring before its ends meet. Glue joins the blue ends too. Ring by ring, the chain grows long. Socks hangs it above the reading corner.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b687522acfa5c2935c7a.mp3",
