  "Chips Packs the Snacks\n\nChips packs a snack for each friend to take to the picnic. An apple and two crackers go into every paper bag. Or do they? Chips checks before closing the bags. One apple sits alone at the bottom of the last bag. Chips adds the missing crackers and closes it. Now everybody gets the same snack.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c848b1da618acdd810b3.mp3",
