  "Chompy Moves a Block\n\nChompy builds a track with a bend for a toy train. A block stands so near the bend that the train gets stuck. Chompy slides the block back a little and tries again. This time the train goes right around the bend. There is room for a toy house on the block now. The train can pass the house without touching it.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/92cabd330506db8493e1.mp3",
