  "Muddy Builds a Clock Stand\n\nFrom Pip’s side of the table, the clock has disappeared. A tall book stands in front of it. Muddy stacks two blocks at the back of the table. Up goes the little clock, right on top of the blocks. Pip can see the clock above the book again. Muddy checks the stand to make sure it is steady.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fcca8a6f215928d2b59f.mp3",
