  "Pip Covers the Plate\n\nAnts were heading straight for Pip’s picnic plate. The grapes were still on it. Pip lowered a mesh cover over them. Air could pass through the tiny holes. The ants stayed outside. Pip carried the grapes to the picnic table, safe under the cover.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3f0919f6ff09aad8e80f.mp3",
