  "Chips Makes Space for a Picture\n\n“Look at my duck,” said Chips, holding up a picture. Chips had made it for the shelf, but a vase stood there. There was no space beside it. Chips carried the vase to another shelf. Now there was a place for the duck. Chips set the picture there.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2a0d6ebf97067f1127c9.mp3",
