  "Socks Finds a Game Piece\n\nSocks spread a game out on the table. There should have been one more round piece. Socks looked in the box, then turned the lid over. A piece was stuck underneath! It was the same shape as the pieces on the board. Socks lifted it off and put it with the others.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6ec290b7342d72f97112.mp3",
