  "On the tray and one plate": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c9a50f1a3ec57b20abd9.mp3",
  "Chips Measures a Ribbon\n\nThe short ribbon would not go round the little gift box. Chips laid a longer ribbon beside a ruler. Chips found the line for five inches. Chips cut there and tried the ribbon round the box. It was the right size, and Chips tied a bow.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8bdc2290624971eb0b1c.mp3",
