  "Chompy Makes a Reading Tent\n\nA sheet hung over two chairs. Chompy crawled inside with a book and a cushion. The space was wide enough to sit down. But how could Chompy read in the dark? Chompy lifted one side of the sheet. Light came in. It was reading time.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fca3a1f1b0c6545a2b16.mp3",
