  "Pip Sorts the Socks\n\nInside the basket Pip found five socks. Two had a red stripe and two had a blue stripe. Pip set those pairs together. One plain white sock was left. Its partner was still on the washing line. Now even the white sock had a match.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f8711c1adcdfe0d8e9b8.mp3",
