  "Chompy Delivers a Note\n\nChompy came with a note, but nobody was at home. Close to the door was a letter box. Chompy folded the note small enough for the slot. It dropped inside. When the rain began, Chompy had already gone. “Come and play after the rain,” said the note inside.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/dfd587cb22431226ddc7.mp3",
