  "Chips Puts the Hose Away\n\nA hose stretched across the garden path. Soon a friend would come along that path on the way home. Chips moved a stone away from the hose. Then Chips rolled the hose into a circle by the wall. The friend walked past on the clear path. Chips waved.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/143c86f145731e6a12f8.mp3",
