  "Muddy Looks Through a Tube\n\nMuddy tried to use a cardboard tube to see a toy. No toy! Paper covered the far end of the tube. Muddy began to peel it off. With both ends open, Muddy looked again. There was the toy, right on the shelf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/eb1235c90fe4b0bfce09.mp3",
