  "Socks Gives the Flute a Rest\n\nSocks was playing a tune on the flute. A friend began a story. To let everyone hear, Socks set the flute on a cloth. The flute could rest there until the story ended. At the end the friend asked for music. Now Socks could use the flute again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e6ef142867e5b7d9bcbc.mp3",
