  "Fluff Chooses Two Shelves\n\nCould Fluff fit all the toy animals on these shelves? The giraffe stood in front of the ducks and hid them. Fluff set it on the low shelf where its long neck fit. The little ducks went up on the high shelf. Now Fluff could see every animal.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/48306bde8eb919b07644.mp3",
  "What was hard to see at first?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3776fa76697389e07f29.mp3",
