  "Muddy Builds a Train Bridge\n\nMuddy’s toy train track had a gap in the rail. Muddy set two blocks under a flat board. The board reached from one end of the gap to the other. Across went the train without a fall. “Once more,” said Muddy, clapping as the train went round again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5486cb9458fe72389dd2.mp3",
