  "Socks Offers a Seat\n\nThe seat by the train window was a good one. Socks sat there until a friend got on with a heavy bag. Every seat was full. “Sit here,” said Socks, standing as the friend put the bag down. Socks held the rail to stay steady. They could wait for their stop together.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/1b65a6671c5a168ea137.mp3",
