  "Chips Paints a Chair\n\nChips spread paper under an old chair. An adult helped Chips give it a coat of blue paint. It needed time to dry. Dark clouds came over the garden before the paint was dry. They carried the chair under the porch roof to wait. The rain could come now.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/7359d24c5f390a1b3cd5.mp3",
