  "Chompy Adds a Sail\n\nThe toy boat floats on the tray of water without moving. Chompy fixes a paper sail to a short stick. The stick stands in a hole in the boat. Chompy blows on the sail and waits. There it goes! The boat moves across the tray.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d0ecbc588c2f7d0d254d.mp3",
