  "Fluff Makes a Soft Bed\n\nFluff visits the farm on a cold day. A rabbit needs fresh hay for its bed. An adult opens a bag beside the pen. Fluff and the adult lay the hay in a dry corner. The rabbit hops over and settles on its soft new bed. Fluff watches from outside the pen.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c555a5f8aef5901535da.mp3",
