  "Pip Makes a Clay Bowl\n\nPip rolled some clay into a ball and pressed a thumb inside. There was a hollow for beads, but it was too shallow. Pip pressed more clay around the edge. Now the sides stood higher. Pip set the little bowl on a tray to dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b0693db53a1fdd204175.mp3",
