  "Muddy Carries the Cups\n\nThree empty cups stood on Muddy’s tray. Muddy lifted it with one hoof and the cups slid sideways. Down went the tray before a cup could fall. Muddy tried again, holding it flat with both front hooves. This time no cup slid away on the way to the table.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9bca81f157f8681be673.mp3",
