  "How many cups reach the table?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/292542a89716f1022373.mp3",
  "Socks Changes the Play Space\n\nOn a rainy day Socks brought out a ball. One look at the slippery grass was enough. It was too wet to run. Socks put the ball away and chose a puzzle. “Stay and help,” Socks said to some friends. They would play outside once the grass was dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/bad76a395777a78cae8a.mp3",
