  "Chompy Folds a Sheet\n\nChompy’s clean sheet stretched farther than three little mats. Chompy spread it out, then stepped both feet off it. A friend took two corners and Chompy held the other two. Together they brought the corners to meet. The folded sheet fit neatly on the shelf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/135ad91671490e28f360.mp3",
