  "Muddy Watches a Bee\n\nMuddy leaned closer to see a bee on a flower. An adult pointed to a tree a little farther back. Muddy watched from there as the bee visited another flower. Even beside the tree, Muddy could see without touching. When the bee flew away, Muddy waved.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c5dac5fd80ff1b08aae8.mp3",
