  "Three Beads Under a Chair\n\nPip tips out a bag of beads. Three green ones roll under a low chair. Pip sees them, but the space is too narrow to reach into. Pip slips a tray under the chair. With a soft brush Pip rolls each bead onto it. Pip pulls out the tray and counts: one, two, three.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/cd75e75e8af6bfe7c69c.mp3",
