  "Socks Finds the Meeting Tree\n\nPip will get a ball, then meet Socks by a tree. But three trees stand by the playground. “Let’s agree on one tree,” says Pip. Socks points to the tree beside a red bench. Pip nods. Later, Pip goes straight to that bench and finds Socks waiting.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ade4ae7a852bddbbc291.mp3",
