  "Chips Presses a Leaf\n\nChips found a damp leaf under a tree. Chips patted it with clean paper. Then Chips tucked the leaf between two dry sheets. A heavy book held them down. Several days later the leaf was dry and flat. Into the book of leaves it went.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e6bfa63b6ee39f95a42c.mp3",
