  "Chompy Leaves the Shell\n\nChompy walked the beach with an adult, looking at each shell. One of the shells moved! A little crab came out. Chompy put the shell back beside the sea. The crab walked towards a rock pool. Chompy took out a notebook to draw it there.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/add5e2a42d72d8c05863.mp3",
