  "Socks Checks a Coat Pocket\n\nSocks put on a coat, ready to cross the road. The key hook was empty. Socks felt a folded shopping bag deep in the coat pocket. Under the bag, Socks found the house key. Socks locked the door, then used the crossing with an adult.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/69d5a1072a2de3948c60.mp3",
